{"timestamp": "2026-02-04 16:10:21.120946", "event": "llm_start", "messages": "content='Based on the diagnosis report: ### Troubleshooting Diagnosis Report\\n\\n#### Network Description\\nThe network is an SDN star topology with one central switch (switch_0) and multiple edge switches (switch_1, switch_2, switch_3, switch_4). Hosts (host_1, host_2, host_3, host_4) are connected to edge switches, and all devices share a single access subnet (10.0.0.0/24). The SDN controller operates at 20.0.0.100 and manages the switches via OpenFlow.\\n\\n#### Observations\\n1. **Host Reachability Results**:\\n   - **host_1**:\\n     - Unable to reach **host_2** (status: unknown).\\n     - Unable to reach **host_4** (status: unknown).\\n   - **host_2**:\\n     - Successfully reached **host_4** with 0% packet loss and average RTT of 10.384 ms.\\n   - **host_3**:\\n     - Successfully reached **host_2** with 0% packet loss and average RTT of 12.304 ms.\\n     - Successfully reached **host_4** with 0% packet loss and average RTT of 10.526 ms.\\n   - **host_4**:\\n     - Successfully reached **host_2** with 0% packet loss and average RTT of 11.639 ms.\\n\\n2. **Anomalies**:\\n   - **host_1** is unable to communicate with other hosts (**host_2** and **host_4**). This indicates potential connectivity issues involving **host_1** or its associated edge switch (**switch_1**).\\n   - Other hosts (**host_2**, **host_3**, and **host_4**) exhibit normal communication with each other, suggesting that their connections and associated edge switches (**switch_2**, **switch_3**, **switch_4**) are functioning correctly.\\n\\n#### Findings\\n- The network appears to have localized issues affecting **host_1** or its edge switch (**switch_1**). This is evident from the inability of **host_1** to reach other hosts, while other hosts communicate successfully.\\n- The central switch (**switch_0**) and the SDN controller (20.0.0.100) are likely operational, as communication between other hosts is unaffected.\\n\\n#### Next Steps\\nFurther investigation is required to pinpoint the root cause of the connectivity issues involving **host_1**. This may involve examining the network configuration, switch status, and OpenFlow rules for **switch_1** and **host_1**.\\n\\nThis concludes the initial diagnostic report., please provide the submission. Do not submit if no report available.' additional_kwargs={} response_metadata={} id='7a5fb5f8-245a-4003-bb02-ed0afb2bba7a'", "model": {"lc": 1, "type": "constructor", "id": ["langchain", "chat_models", "openai", "ChatOpenAI"], "kwargs": {"model_name": "kt-gpt-oss-rh014", "temperature": 0.0, "openai_api_key": {"lc": 1, "type": "secret", "id": ["OPENAI_API_KEY"]}, "openai_api_base": "https://dev.kora.kt.co.kr/v2", "request_timeout": 180.0, "max_retries": 2}, "name": "ChatOpenAI"}}
